  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Experimental image support\n- Added base64-encoded request assets with automatic TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images opt-in.\n- AssetState and its asynchronous AddImageAsset helper load images through TruePath with optional injectable file access.\n- ImageAsset.FromByteArray(name, format, bytes) uses standard padded base64 without line breaks or a data URI prefix. Callers must supply the matching format.\n\nBounding-box questions and answers\n- BoxQuestionBuilder and BoxAnswer support normalized bounding boxes with confidence.\n- The bundled source generator recognizes IBoxQuestionDefinition and GenericBoxQuestionDefinition and generates requests, typed answer methods, and response wrapper properties.\n- Requests without an explicit model re-evaluate model selection before execution: JevModel.Preview for Box questions, including those added after construction, and JevModel.Latest otherwise. Explicit model choices are preserved.\n- Added AnswerExtensions helpers for typed answer filtering: OnlyNoul(), OnlyChoice(), OnlyScoreAnswer(), and OnlyBoxAnswer().\n\nError handling and fixes\n- API error translation preserves JSON or raw response content and retains the HTTP failure description in exception messages.\n- Added known-error handling for HTTP 400, 413, 415, and 529 while retaining 509 support.\n- Duplicate asset fields no longer replace registered assets before throwing.\n\nDocumentation and coverage\n- Updated documentation and regression coverage for image requests, generated Box queries, and API errors.",
